sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Researcher as 研究員
    actor Scheduler as 排程器
    participant Import as Import-EarthquakeCatalog
    participant Baseline as Compute-Baseline
    participant Ingest as Ingest-Precursors
    participant Scoring as Risk-Scoring
    participant Visualize as Visualize-Results
    participant Validator as HistoricalValidator
    participant Storage as 檔案系統 / GitHub Artifacts
    
    Note over Researcher, Storage: 手動執行或排程觸發
    
    Scheduler->>Import: 啟動管道
    Researcher->>Import: 手動執行
    
    Import->>Storage: 讀取 CWA_catalog.csv
    Storage-->>Import: 地震目錄資料
    Import->>Import: 驗證欄位 (時間、經緯度、ML、深度)
    Import->>Import: 型別檢查與範圍驗證
    Import-->>Researcher: 輸出前 5 筆供檢閱
    
    Import->>Baseline: 傳遞目錄路徑
    Baseline->>Storage: 讀取目錄
    Baseline->>Baseline: 解析時間、篩選最近 30 天
    Baseline->>Baseline: 計算平均 ML、深度、日均震頻
    Baseline->>Storage: 儲存 baseline.json
    Baseline-->>Researcher: 輸出基線結果
    
    Baseline->>Ingest: 觸發前驅整合
    Ingest->>Storage: 讀取 precursor_data/ 7 類檔案
    Storage-->>Ingest: GPS、地磁、地下水、TEC、氣壓、雨量、潮汐
    Ingest->>Ingest: 統一時間戳 (ObservationTime)
    Ingest->>Ingest: 加入來源標記
    Ingest->>Storage: 輸出 precursors_combined.csv
    Ingest-->>Researcher: 輸出合併筆數與範例
    
    Ingest->>Scoring: 傳遞特徵路徑
    Scoring->>Storage: 讀取 features_normalized.csv
    Scoring->>Storage: 讀取 baseline.json
    Scoring->>Scoring: Weighted Sum 計算 (Σ normalized × weight × 100)
    Scoring->>Scoring: 計算相對基線增加百分比
    Scoring->>Scoring: 找出前 3 大貢獻來源
    Scoring->>Scoring: 產生「基於 X、Y、Z 觀測，區域風險上升 N%」摘要
    Scoring->>Storage: 儲存 risk_scores.csv
    Scoring-->>Researcher: 輸出最近 5 筆摘要
    
    Scoring->>Visualize: 傳遞風險分數路徑
    Visualize->>Storage: 讀取 risk_scores.csv
    Visualize->>Visualize: Python matplotlib/seaborn 繪圖
    Visualize->>Visualize: 時間序列圖、熱力圖、地圖熱圖
    Visualize->>Storage: 儲存 PNG/HTML 圖表
    Visualize-->>Researcher: 視覺化完成通知
    
    Scoring->>Validator: 觸發歷史驗證
    Validator->>Storage: 讀取歷史 M>=5.5 地震
    Validator->>Storage: 讀取 risk_scores.csv
    Validator->>Validator: 計算命中率、漏報率、誤報率
    Validator->>Validator: 1/3/7 天前分數檢查
    Validator->>Storage: 儲存 validation_report.json
    Validator-->>Researcher: 驗證報告
    
    Validator->>Scoring: 回饋權重調整建議
    Scoring->>Storage: 更新 WeightConfig
    
    Storage->>GitHub: 上傳 artifacts
    GitHub-->>Researcher: 工作流程完成
